{"id": "q0406", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.05, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1237, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What is Pickleball?", "transcript": "What is pickleball?", "first_audio_ms": 636, "spoken_s": 27.24, "mode": "local", "answer": "Pickleball is a fun sport played on a court that's smaller than a tennis court, with a net in the middle. It uses a plastic paddle to hit a lightweight plastic ball over the net. Players can stand on one or both sides of the net, and it’s usually played indoors or outdoors. It combines elements of tennis, badminton, and ping-pong, making it easy to learn but challenging to master. It's popular because it's great for all ages and fitness levels!", "answer_ms": 13669}
{"id": "q0415", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.91, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.4818, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "List five titles by Kevin Kwan.", "transcript": "List five titles by Kevin Kwan.", "first_audio_ms": 25, "stall_pcm_s": 3.64, "relay_first_audio_ms": 670, "spoken_s": 14.2, "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Sure! Here are five titles by Kevin Kwan. First is \"Crazy Rich Asians,\" then \"China Rich Girlfriend.\" Next, \"Rich People Problems\" and \"Sex and Vanity.\" And lastly, \"Lies and Weddings.\"", "expert_answer": "Five titles by Kevin Kwan:\n\n1. *Crazy Rich Asians*\n2. *China Rich Girlfriend*\n3. *Rich People Problems*\n4. *Sex and Vanity*\n5. *Lies and Weddings*", "expert_latency_s": 2.67, "stall_ms": 25, "relay_ms": 6729}
{"id": "q0425", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.9, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1607, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Provide a bulleted list of things to think about when buying a house", "transcript": "Provide a bulleted list of things to think about when buying a house.", "first_audio_ms": 637, "spoken_s": 34.72, "mode": "local", "answer": "Here are some things to think about when buying a house:\\n\\n- Location and neighborhood safety.\\n- Proximity to work, schools, and amenities.\\n- Property size and layout.\\n- Potential for future resale value.\\n- Local zoning laws and regulations.\\n- Cost of utilities and property taxes.\\n- Condition of the home and needed repairs.\\n- Environmental factors like flood zones or nearby industrial sites.\\n- Community features such as parks or recreational areas.\\n- Noise levels and nearby traffic.\\n- Future plans for development in the area.", "answer_ms": 17400}
{"id": "q0436", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.04, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1374, "eot_read_ms": 22, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Why does Daenerys Targaryen want to rule Westeros?", "transcript": "Why does Daenerys Targaryen want to rule Westeros?", "first_audio_ms": 643, "spoken_s": 30.96, "mode": "local", "answer": "Daenerys Targaryen wants to rule Westeros because she believes it is her birthright, as the last surviving heir of the Targaryen dynasty. Raised in exile and shaped by her experiences, she sees herself as the rightful queen destined to reclaim the Iron Throne. Her desire to rule stems from a mix of heritage, justice—believing she will bring peace and prosperity—and a sense of duty to restore balance after centuries of war and tyranny.", "answer_ms": 14711}
